qicImm 9 16 53 4 4 qW1
qic 11 21 16 QZ 0 qLd
qicImm 9 16 15 6 4 qW1
qic 11 22 16 QZ 0 qLd
qicImm 9 16 53 6 4 qW1
qic 11 23 16 QZ 0 qLd
qic 0 QZ QZ QZ 0 qW0
qic 30 24 20 23 0 qAlu4
qNum 30 20.0f32
qNum 31 1.4426950408889634f32
qNum 32 0.6931471805599453f32
qNum 36 1.0f32
qicImm 8 28 24 QZ 1 qAlu4
bSp = qBssy
qic 34 0 24 30 0x03f04000 qCmp
skSp = qBraFwd 1
qic 32 29 24 31 0 qAlu4
qic 47 29 29 QZ 0 qMufu
qic 0 QZ QZ QZ 0 qW0
qic 30 29 29 36 0 qAlu4
qic 69 29 29 QZ 0 qMufu
qic 0 QZ QZ QZ 0 qW0
qic 32 28 29 32 0 qAlu4
qPatch skSp 1
qBsync bSp
qic 32 28 22 28 0 qAlu4
qic 32 28 28 31 0 qAlu4
